				\begin{document}$$Relative\, gene \,expression= \frac{{({E}_{GOI})}^{\Delta CtG\, OI}}{GeoMean[{\left({E}_{REF}\right)}^{\Delta Ct\, REF}]}.$$\end{document}Relativegeneexpression=(EGOI)ΔCtGOIGeoMean[EREFΔCtREF].
